---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
import refs from '../../../../../public/equipment/15-07/references.json';
import v from '../../../../../public/equipment/15-07/verification.json';
const a='/equipment/15-07/';
---
<Layout pageTitle="Vevo 3100 · Dormant console and fixed graphic ruler" subtitle="" description="Orbit a dormant Vevo 3100 console and measure the spacing of two drawn lines on a separate synthetic graphic." wide={true}>
<article class="equipment vevo1507">
<nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/15-07/">← Equipment 15-07</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#evidence">Sources &amp; checks</a></nav>
<header class="eq-mast"><span class="eq-meta">15-07 / Vevo 3100 console from the legacy LAZR-X configuration</span><h2>FUJIFILM VisualSonics Vevo 3100 · Exterior &amp; drawn ruler</h2><p>Inspect the fixed console exterior with its displays off. On a separate inert graphic, use the declared row scale to measure the distance between two drawn lines. No image was acquired from an instrument or a specimen.</p></header>
<div class="dn-grid"><section class="dn-card"><h3>3D exhibit</h3>
<div class="dn-bar"><button data-view="whole">Whole exhibit</button><button data-view="front">Console front</button><button data-view="rear">Console rear</button><button data-view="chart">Drawing stand</button><button id="camera-reset">Reset view</button></div>
<div class="dn-camera"><canvas id="vevo-model" aria-label="Disconnected Vevo 3100 cart with blank screens and a separate colored ruler graphic"></canvas></div>
<p id="asset" class="dn-note" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><p class="dn-note">Drag to orbit, pinch or scroll to zoom. Only the detached stand has actions: the amber key cycles the marked pair and the pale key reverses its order. The cart, castors and displays do not move or operate.</p></section>
<section class="dn-card"><h3>Measure two drawn lines</h3><div class="dn-bar"><label>Fixed pair <select id="pair"><option value="AB">A and B</option><option value="AA">A and A</option></select></label><button class="primary" id="reverse" aria-pressed="false">Reverse ruler</button><button id="reset">Reset</button></div>
<canvas id="static-ruler" width="468" height="420" role="img" aria-label="An illustrative 96 by 80 grid containing two colored reference lines at rows 16 and 52"></canvas>
<p class="dn-note" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">A → B · 36 rows · 4.500 mm separation · signed +4.500 mm.</p>
<div class="dn-bar"><button id="json">Export ruler JSON</button><a href={a+'example-ruler.json'}>Example result</a></div>
<p class="dn-note">The original grid has 96 × 80 cells, with the vertical scale set to 0.125 mm per row. The zero is the center of row 0. Rows 16 and 52 are 36 rows apart. Reversing direction changes only the signed difference, not the separation. The marked positions and scale are drawn math, not equipment performance.</p></section></div>
<section id="evidence"><h3>Sources and independent checks</h3>
<div class="photo-pair">
<figure><img src={a+'reference-front.webp'} width="640" height="400" alt="Original front three-quarter 3D render of the fixed Vevo cart with dark displays and wrap-around rail" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Original GLB front render. The <a href={refs.references[1].url}>launch product photograph</a> establishes the upper and lower display arrangement, rail and body shape. The separate ancillary device visible in that photograph is not modeled.</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img src={a+'reference-rear.webp'} width="640" height="400" alt="Original rear three-quarter 3D render showing the fixed closed console shroud" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Original rear render. The rear and underbody are simplified visual estimates, not parts drawings.</figcaption></figure>
</div>
<ul>{refs.references.map(r=><li><a href={r.url}>{r.title}</a>. {r.caption}</li>)}</ul>
<p>The legacy <b>Vevo 3100</b> footprint is <b>540 × 680 mm</b> (W × D), from user manual 51224-03 Rev. 1.4, p. 717. The published 1220 mm height is for a folded screen and is not this exhibit's height. The fixed upright height is an authored 1580 mm photo estimate. This is not Vevo F2. No auxiliary enclosure, probe, specimen platform, cables, controlled ultrasound or laser, imaging/acquisition, emissions, settings, or workflows are implemented.</p>
<div class="dn-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Check</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Tolerance</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead><tbody>{v.checks.map(c=><tr><th scope="row">{c.id}</th><td>{String(c.expected)} {c.unit}</td><td>{typeof c.actual==='number'?Number(c.actual.toFixed(8)):String(c.actual)} {c.unit}</td><td>{c.tolerance===0?'Exact':c.tolerance}</td><td>{c.pass?'Pass':'Fail'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
<p><a href={a+'build-model.py'} download>Editable model</a> · <a href={a+'vevo3100-console.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={a+'references.json'}>Reference notes</a> · <a href={a+'vr-station.json'}>VR action manifest</a> · <a href={a+'ruler.mjs'}>Independent ruler module</a> · <a href={a+'verification.json'}>Verification JSON</a>. No headset session tested.</p>
</section></article></Layout><script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/15-07/client.mjs';</script>
<style>
.vevo1507{--dn-rule:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 26%,transparent);max-width:1280px;margin:auto}.dn-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.08fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem}.dn-card{min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--dn-rule);padding:.85rem;margin:.8rem 0}.dn-card h3{margin:.21rem 0 .6rem}.dn-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem;margin:.53rem 0}.dn-bar,.dn-note,.dn-fig figcaption{font:.89rem/1.4 system-ui,sans-serif}
.vevo1507 :is(button,select){font:inherit;padding:.4rem;background:var(--panel,Canvas);color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--dn-rule);border-radius:3px;min-height:38px;cursor:pointer}.vevo1507 .primary{background:#34594f;color:#fff}.dn-camera{aspect-ratio:1.34;background:#263b40}.dn-camera canvas{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;touch-action:none}.vevo1507 #static-ruler{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:492px;margin:.6rem 0}.dn-table{overflow:auto}.dn-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.dn-table :is(td,th){border-bottom:1px solid var(--dn-rule);padding:.42rem;text-align:left}.dn-fig{margin:1rem 0;max-width:680px}.dn-fig img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.dn-fig figcaption{margin:.38rem 0}@media(max-width:850px){.dn-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.vevo1507 .photo-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.8rem;max-width:860px}.vevo1507 .photo-pair figure{margin:0}.vevo1507 .photo-pair img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.vevo1507 .photo-pair figcaption{font:.86rem/1.4 system-ui,sans-serif;margin:.3rem 0}@media(max-width:600px){.vevo1507 .photo-pair{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
